om Layla to the team.","ar":"ثالثاً: ملاحظة إنتاج من ليلى إلى الفريق."},"id":"L013"},{"actor":"nour","start":72.193,"text":{"en":"Dear team. First blank is. Then blank is.","ar":"فريقي العزيز. أوّلاً ـــ يُـ. ثمّ ـــ يُـ."},"id":"L014"},{"actor":"nour","start":78.279,"text":{"en":"Finally blank is delivered on blank.","ar":"أخيراً ـــ يُسلَّم في ـــ."},"id":"L015"},{"actor":"sami","start":81.749,"text":{"en":"What must that note include besides the steps?","ar":"ماذا يجب أن تتضمّن تلك الملاحظة إضافة إلى الخطوات؟"},"subHold":9.162,"id":"L016"},{"actor":"sami","start":90.911,"text":{"en":"A clear order, and a day for the delivery.","ar":"ترتيب واضح، ويوم للتسليم."},"id":"L017"},{"actor":"nour","start":94.405,"text":{"en":"Fourth: a reflection on something made in your town.","ar":"رابعاً: تأمّل في شيء يُصنع في بلدتك."},"id":"L018"},{"actor":"nour","start":98.595,"text":{"en":"Forty to sixty words, with the passive and two or three steps.","ar":"أربعون إلى ستّون كلمة، بالمجهول وخطوتين أو ثلاث."},"id":"L019"},{"actor":"sami","start":103.625,"text":{"en":"What does that reflection need?","ar":"ماذا يحتاج ذلك التأمّل؟"},"subHold":7.295,"id":"L020"},{"actor":"sami","start":110.92,"text":{"en":"The passive, and two or three steps.","ar":"المبنيّ للمجهول، وخطوتان أو ثلاث."},"id":"L021"},{"actor":"nour","start":114.534,"text":{"en":"Every task wants the same two things.","ar":"كلّ مهمّة تريد الأمرين نفسيهما."},"id":"L022"},{"actor":"nour","start":118.004,"text":{"en":"What happens, and in what order.","ar":"ماذا يحدث، وبأيّ ترتيب."},"id":"L023"},{"actor":"nour","start":121.282,"text":{"en":"Now write. The video stops here, and your pen starts.","ar":"الآن اكتب. الفيديو يتوقّف هنا، وقلمك يبدأ."},"id":"L024"}],"subtitles":{"enabled":true,"langs":"en,ar","show":null,"textMode":"wrapShrink","lang":{}},"badgePlacement":{"x":"0.016","y":"0.016","width":"0.205"},"audio":{"master":"audio.m4a","lines":[{"key":"69d7102c12dcc8b4","bytes":46368,"sha":"dd8353fd224f1b12","address":"lines/6